{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c4d0c964682a3e40","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start Application] --> B{Execution Mode?}\n    \n    %% FastAPI Mode\n    B -->|FastAPI Server| C[Initialize FastAPI App]\n    C --> D[Start Server]\n    \n    D --> E[POST /runMongoMetadata]\n    D --> F[POST /runRelationshipInference]\n    D --> G[POST /runEdgeMetadata]\n    \n    %% Direct Execution Mode\n    B -->|Direct Execution| H[Run All Tasks Sequentially]\n    H --> I[Task 1: MongoDB Metadata]\n    I --> J[Task 2: Relationship Inference]\n    J --> K[Task 3: Edge Metadata]\n    \n    %% Task Processing\n    E --> L[MongoDB Metadata Processor]\n    F --> M[Relationship Inference Engine]\n    G --> N[Edge Metadata Generator]\n    I --> L\n    J --> M\n    K --> N\n    \n    %% Data Processing Flow\n    L --> O[Process Tables & Columns<br/>Generate Metadata with LLM]\n    M --> P[Analyze Semantic Relationships<br/>Between Tables]\n    N --> Q[Create Graph Edges<br/>Between Entities]\n    \n    %% Storage\n    O --> R[(MongoDB)]\n    P --> R\n    Q --> R\n    \n    %% Results\n    O --> S[Return Processing Results]\n    P --> T[Return Inference Results]\n    Q --> U[Return Edge Results]\n    \n    %% Styling\n    classDef apiEndpoint fill:#e1f5fe\n    classDef task fill:#f3e5f5\n    classDef processor fill:#e8f5e8\n    classDef storage fill:#fff3e0\n    classDef result fill:#ffebee\n    \n    class E,F,G apiEndpoint\n    class L,M,N processor\n    class O,P,Q task\n    class R storage\n    class S,T,U result\n```\n","x":-53040,"y":17660,"width":1720,"height":1260},
		{"id":"98fe3136e1d73855","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant FastAPI as FastAPI App\n    participant Task1 as MongoDB Metadata Processor\n    participant Task2 as Relationship Inference\n    participant Task3 as Edge Metadata Generator\n    participant MongoDB as MongoDB Database\n    participant LLM as Azure OpenAI\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: FastAPI Server Mode\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runMongoMetadata\n    FastAPI->>+Task1: Process metadata generation\n    Task1->>+MongoDB: Read table & column data\n    MongoDB-->>-Task1: Return data\n    Task1->>+LLM: Generate metadata & embeddings\n    LLM-->>-Task1: Return enriched metadata\n    Task1->>+MongoDB: Update with metadata\n    MongoDB-->>-Task1: Confirm updates\n    Task1-->>-FastAPI: Task complete\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runRelationshipInference\n    FastAPI->>+Task2: Analyze relationships\n    Task2->>+MongoDB: Load tables with embeddings\n    MongoDB-->>-Task2: Return embedded data\n    Task2->>Task2: Calculate semantic similarity\n    Task2->>+LLM: Infer relationships\n    LLM-->>-Task2: Return relationship data\n    Task2->>+MongoDB: Update relationships\n    MongoDB-->>-Task2: Confirm updates\n    Task2-->>-FastAPI: Task complete\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runEdgeMetadata\n    FastAPI->>+Task3: Generate graph edges\n    Task3->>+MongoDB: Read processed data\n    MongoDB-->>-Task3: Return data\n    Task3->>Task3: Create edge relationships\n    Task3->>+MongoDB: Insert edge metadata\n    MongoDB-->>-Task3: Confirm inserts\n    Task3-->>-FastAPI: Task complete\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: Direct Execution Mode (main.py)\n\n    participant Main as main.py\n    \n    Main->>+Task1: Execute Task 1\n    Task1->>MongoDB: Process metadata\n    Task1-->>-Main: Task 1 complete\n\n    Main->>+Task2: Execute Task 2\n    Task2->>MongoDB: Process relationships\n    Task2-->>-Main: Task 2 complete\n\n    Main->>+Task3: Execute Task 3\n    Task3->>MongoDB: Process edges\n    Task3-->>-Main: Task 3 complete\n\n    Main->>Main: All tasks completed\n```\n","x":-53040,"y":19240,"width":1920,"height":2280},
		{"id":"68344b99b92ba10b","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start Application] --> B{Execution Mode?}\n    \n    %% FastAPI Mode\n    B -->|FastAPI Server| C[Initialize FastAPI App]\n    C --> D[Add CORS Middleware]\n    D --> E[Start Server - Await API Calls]\n    \n    E --> F[POST /runMongoMetadata]\n    E --> G[POST /runRelationshipInference]\n    E --> H[POST /runEdgeMetadata]\n    \n    F --> I[Execute MongoDB Metadata Task]\n    G --> J[Execute Relationship Inference Task]\n    H --> K[Execute Edge Metadata Task]\n    \n    %% Direct Execution Mode\n    B -->|Direct Execution| L[Run All Tasks Sequentially]\n    L --> M[Task 1: MongoDB Metadata]\n    M --> N[Task 2: Relationship Inference]\n    N --> O[Task 3: Edge Metadata]\n    \n    %% Task Processing\n    I --> P[mongodb_processor.py]\n    J --> Q[run_relationship_inference_task.py]\n    K --> R[run_edge_metadata_task.py]\n    M --> P\n    N --> Q\n    O --> R\n    \n    %% Utility Services\n    P --> S[Utils Layer]\n    Q --> S\n    R --> S\n    \n    S --> T[config.py - Configuration]\n    S --> U[helper_functions.py - Utilities]\n    S --> V[llm_query.py - LLM Interactions]\n    S --> W[parse_response.py - Response Parsing]\n    S --> X[load_prompt.py - Prompt Loading]\n    \n    %% Results\n    I --> Y[Return Success/Error Response]\n    J --> Z[Return Success/Error Response]\n    K --> AA[Return Success/Error Response]\n    \n    M --> BB[Log Task 1 Result]\n    N --> CC[Log Task 2 Result]\n    O --> DD[Log Task 3 Result]\n    \n    BB --> EE[All Tasks Completed]\n    CC --> EE\n    DD --> EE\n    \n    %% Styling\n    classDef apiEndpoint fill:#e1f5fe\n    classDef task fill:#f3e5f5\n    classDef utility fill:#e8f5e8\n    classDef result fill:#fff3e0\n    \n    class F,G,H apiEndpoint\n    class I,J,K,M,N,O task\n    class S,T,U,V,W,X utility\n    class Y,Z,AA,BB,CC,DD,EE result\n```\n","x":-34560,"y":4373,"width":3040,"height":1460},
		{"id":"0d7e4b7e129eeabd","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant FastAPI as FastAPI App\n    participant MongoDB as mongodb_processor\n    participant RelInf as relationship_inference\n    participant EdgeMeta as edge_metadata_task\n    participant Utils as Utils Layer\n    participant Config as config.py\n    participant Helper as helper_functions.py\n    participant LLM as llm_query.py\n    participant Parser as parse_response.py\n    participant Prompt as load_prompt.py\n\n    Note over Client, Prompt: FastAPI Server Mode\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runMongoMetadata\n    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Print \"Starting MongoDB Metadata Task...\"\n    FastAPI->>+MongoDB: run_mongodb_metadata_task()\n    \n    MongoDB->>+Utils: Initialize processing\n    Utils->>+Config: Load configuration\n    Config-->>-Utils: Return config\n    Utils->>+Helper: Get helper functions\n    Helper-->>-Utils: Return utilities\n    Utils->>+Prompt: Load prompts\n    Prompt-->>-Utils: Return prompts\n    \n    MongoDB->>+LLM: Query LLM for metadata\n    LLM-->>-MongoDB: LLM response\n    MongoDB->>+Parser: Parse LLM response\n    Parser-->>-MongoDB: Parsed data\n    \n    MongoDB-->>-FastAPI: Return success/failure\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: JSONResponse (success/error)\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runRelationshipInference\n    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Print \"Starting Relationship Inference Task...\"\n    FastAPI->>+RelInf: run_relationship_inference_task()\n    \n    RelInf->>+Utils: Initialize processing\n    Utils->>Config: Load configuration\n    Utils->>Helper: Get helper functions\n    Utils->>Prompt: Load prompts\n    \n    RelInf->>+LLM: Query LLM for relationships\n    LLM-->>-RelInf: LLM response\n    RelInf->>+Parser: Parse relationships\n    Parser-->>-RelInf: Parsed relationships\n    \n    RelInf-->>-FastAPI: Return success/failure\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: JSONResponse (success/error)\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /runEdgeMetadata\n    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Print \"Starting Edge Metadata Task...\"\n    FastAPI->>+EdgeMeta: edge_metadata_task()\n    \n    EdgeMeta->>+Utils: Initialize processing\n    Utils->>Config: Load configuration\n    Utils->>Helper: Get helper functions\n    Utils->>Prompt: Load prompts\n    \n    EdgeMeta->>+LLM: Query LLM for edge metadata\n    LLM-->>-EdgeMeta: LLM response\n    EdgeMeta->>+Parser: Parse edge data\n    Parser-->>-EdgeMeta: Parsed edge metadata\n    \n    EdgeMeta-->>-FastAPI: Return success/failure\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: JSONResponse (success/error)\n\n    Note over Client, Prompt: Direct Execution Mode (main.py)\n\n    participant Main as main.py\n    \n    Main->>Main: Start run_all_tasks()\n    Main->>Main: Log \"TASK 1: Running MongoDB metadata generation...\"\n    Main->>+MongoDB: run_mongodb_metadata_task()\n    \n    MongoDB->>Utils: Process metadata (same as above)\n    MongoDB-->>-Main: Return success/failure\n    Main->>Main: Log Task 1 result\n    \n    Main->>Main: Log \"TASK 2: Running relationship inference...\"\n    Main->>+RelInf: run_relationship_inference_task()\n    RelInf->>Utils: Process relationships (same as above)\n    RelInf-->>-Main: Return success/failure\n    Main->>Main: Log Task 2 result\n    \n    Main->>Main: Log \"TASK 3: Running Edge Metadata generation...\"\n    Main->>+EdgeMeta: run_edge_metadata_task()\n    EdgeMeta->>Utils: Process edge metadata (same as above)\n    EdgeMeta-->>-Main: Return success/failure\n    Main->>Main: Log Task 3 result\n    \n    Main->>Main: Log \"ALL TASKS COMPLETED\"\n```\n","x":-29120,"y":4373,"width":2760,"height":3440},
		{"id":"3c091fa4bcbba723","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    %% == FastAPI App Layer ==\n    subgraph \"🧩 FastAPI Application\"\n        APP[\"app.py\\nFastAPI Instance\"]\n        CORS[\"CORS Middleware\"]\n        APP --> CORS\n    end\n\n    %% == Standalone Script ==\n    MAIN[\"main.py\\nStandalone Script Runner\"]\n\n    %% == API Endpoints ==\n    subgraph \"🌐 API Endpoints\"\n        EP1[\"/runMongoMetadata\\nPOST\"]\n        EP2[\"/runAzureSearch\\nPOST\"]\n        EP3[\"/runRelationshipInference\\nPOST\"]\n    end\n\n    %% == Service Layer ==\n    subgraph \"🛠 Services\"\n        MONGO_SVC[\"mongodb_processor.py\\nrun_mongodb_metadata_task()\"]\n        AZURE_SVC[\"run_azure_search_task.py\\nrun_azure_search_task()\"]\n        REL_SVC[\"run_relationship_inference_task.py\\nrun_relationship_inference_task()\"]\n        EDGE_SVC[\"run_edge_metadata_task.py\\nrun_edge_metadata_task()\"]\n    end\n\n    %% == Utils Layer ==\n    subgraph \"🔧 Utilities\"\n        CONFIG[\"config.py\\nConfiguration\"]\n        HELPER[\"helper_functions.py\\nHelper Functions\"]\n        LLM[\"llm_query.py\\nLLM Queries\"]\n        PARSE[\"parse_response.py\\nResponse Parser\"]\n        LOAD[\"load_prompt.py\\nPrompt Loader\"]\n    end\n\n    %% == Prompts ==\n    subgraph \"🧾 Prompt Files\"\n        PROMPT1[\"clean_table_name.txt\\nTable Name Cleaning\"]\n    end\n\n    %% == Task Execution Flow ==\n    subgraph \"⚙️ Task Execution Flow\"\n        direction LR\n        T1[\"Task 1:\\nMongoDB Metadata\"]\n        T2[\"Task 2:\\nAzure Search Indexing\"]\n        T3[\"Task 3:\\nRelationship Inference\"]\n        T4[\"Task 4:\\nEdge Metadata\"]\n        T1 --> T2 --> T3 --> T4\n    end\n\n    %% == API Connections ==\n    APP --> EP1 --> MONGO_SVC\n    APP --> EP2 --> AZURE_SVC\n    APP --> EP3 --> REL_SVC\n\n    %% == Main.py Task Flow ==\n    MAIN --> MONGO_SVC\n    MAIN --> AZURE_SVC\n    MAIN --> REL_SVC\n    MAIN --> EDGE_SVC\n\n    %% == Service Dependencies ==\n    MONGO_SVC --> CONFIG\n    MONGO_SVC --> HELPER\n    MONGO_SVC --> LLM\n    MONGO_SVC --> PARSE\n    MONGO_SVC --> LOAD\n\n    AZURE_SVC --> CONFIG\n    AZURE_SVC --> HELPER\n    AZURE_SVC --> LLM\n    AZURE_SVC --> PARSE\n    AZURE_SVC --> LOAD\n\n    REL_SVC --> CONFIG\n    REL_SVC --> HELPER\n    REL_SVC --> LLM\n    REL_SVC --> PARSE\n    REL_SVC --> LOAD\n\n    EDGE_SVC --> CONFIG\n    EDGE_SVC --> HELPER\n    EDGE_SVC --> LLM\n    EDGE_SVC --> PARSE\n    EDGE_SVC --> LOAD\n\n    LOAD --> PROMPT1\n\n    %% == Responses ==\n    subgraph \"📤 Response Types\"\n        SUCCESS[\"JSONResponse\\nSuccess\"]\n        ERROR[\"HTTPException\\nFailure\"]\n    end\n\n    EP1 --> SUCCESS\n    EP1 --> ERROR\n    EP2 --> SUCCESS\n    EP2 --> ERROR\n    EP3 --> SUCCESS\n    EP3 --> ERROR\n\n    %% == Styling ==\n    classDef apiClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef serviceClass fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef utilClass fill:#f1f8e9,stroke:#33691e,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef promptClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef taskClass fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#ad1457,stroke-width:2px\n\n    class APP,CORS,EP1,EP2,EP3 apiClass\n    class MONGO_SVC,AZURE_SVC,REL_SVC,EDGE_SVC serviceClass\n    class CONFIG,HELPER,LLM,PARSE,LOAD utilClass\n    class PROMPT1 promptClass\n    class T1,T2,T3,T4 taskClass\n```\n","x":-38400,"y":6720,"width":3840,"height":3520},
		{"id":"5f62a3949b07d3bb","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start Application] --> B{Execution Mode?}\n    \n    %% FastAPI Mode\n    B -->|FastAPI Server| C[Initialize FastAPI App]\n    C --> D[Add CORS Middleware]\n    D --> E[Start Server - Await API Calls]\n    \n    E --> F[POST /runMongoMetadata]\n    E --> G[POST /runRelationshipInference]\n    E --> H[POST /runEdgeMetadata]\n    \n    %% Direct Execution Mode\n    B -->|Direct Execution main.py| L[Run All Tasks Sequentially]\n    L --> M[Task 1: MongoDB Metadata]\n    M --> N[Task 2: Relationship Inference]\n    N --> O[Task 3: Edge Metadata]\n    \n    %% Task 1: MongoDB Metadata Processing\n    F --> P1[MongoDBMetadataProcessor]\n    M --> P1\n    P1 --> P2[Connect to MongoDB Collections<br/>table_metadata & column_metadata]\n    P2 --> P3[Initialize Azure OpenAI LLM]\n    P3 --> P4[Process Tables in Batches of 4]\n    P4 --> P5[For Each Table:]\n    P5 --> P6[Clean Table Label with LLM]\n    P6 --> P7[Get Columns for Table]\n    P7 --> P8[Create System & User Prompts]\n    P8 --> P9[Query LLM for Metadata]\n    P9 --> P10[Parse LLM Response JSON]\n    P10 --> P11[Generate Embeddings for Table & Columns]\n    P11 --> P12[Update MongoDB with:<br/>- Description<br/>- Embedding Input<br/>- Embedding Vector<br/>- Tags<br/>- Foreign Keys]\n    \n    %% Task 2: Relationship Inference\n    G --> Q1[RelationshipInference]\n    N --> Q1\n    Q1 --> Q2[Load All Tables & Columns with Embeddings]\n    Q2 --> Q3[For Each Target Table:]\n    Q3 --> Q4[Find Similar Tables using<br/>Cosine Similarity Top 5]\n    Q4 --> Q5[Find Similar Columns using<br/>Cosine Similarity Top 5]\n    Q5 --> Q6[Create Relationship Prompt<br/>with Similar Entities]\n    Q6 --> Q7[Query LLM for Relationships]\n    Q7 --> Q8[Parse Foreign Keys &<br/>Primary Key References]\n    Q8 --> Q9[Update Table with:<br/>- foreign_keys_referencing_tables<br/>- primary_keys_referencing_tables]\n    Q9 --> Q10[Process Bidirectional<br/>Relationship Updates]\n    \n    %% Task 3: Edge Metadata Generation\n    H --> R1[EdgeMetadataGenerator]\n    O --> R1\n    R1 --> R2[Connect to MongoDB<br/>Create edge_metadata Collection]\n    R2 --> R3[Process Source-to-Table Edges]\n    R3 --> R4[Process Table-to-Table Edges<br/>from primary_keys_referencing_tables]\n    R4 --> R5[Process Table-to-Column Edges]\n    R5 --> R6[For Each Edge Type:]\n    R6 --> R7[Check Duplicate Conditions<br/>- Exact Match<br/>- Reverse Match]\n    R7 --> R8[Create Edge Documents with:<br/>- HAS_TABLE<br/>- HAS_FOREIGN_KEY<br/>- HAS_CROSS_REFERENCE<br/>- HAS_COLUMN]\n    R8 --> R9[Insert into edge_metadata Collection]\n    \n    %% Utility Services\n    P9 --> S[Utils Layer]\n    Q7 --> S\n    S --> T[config.py - MongoDB & OpenAI Config]\n    S --> U[helper_functions.py - Utilities]\n    S --> V[llm_query.py - Azure OpenAI Queries]\n    S --> W[parse_response.py - JSON Response Parsing]\n    S --> X[load_prompt.py - Prompt Templates]\n    \n    %% Results\n    P12 --> Y1[Return Batch Processing Results]\n    Q10 --> Y2[Return Relationship Inference Results]\n    R9 --> Y3[Return Edge Generation Results]\n    \n    Y1 --> Z1[Log Success/Failure]\n    Y2 --> Z2[Log Success/Failure]\n    Y3 --> Z3[Log Success/Failure]\n    \n    %% Styling\n    classDef apiEndpoint fill:#e1f5fe\n    classDef task fill:#f3e5f5\n    classDef processor fill:#e8f5e8\n    classDef utility fill:#fff3e0\n    classDef result fill:#ffebee\n    \n    class F,G,H apiEndpoint\n    class P1,Q1,R1 processor\n    class P4,P5,P6,P7,P8,P9,P10,P11,P12,Q3,Q4,Q5,Q6,Q7,Q8,Q9,Q10,R3,R4,R5,R6,R7,R8,R9 task\n    class S,T,U,V,W,X utility\n    class Y1,Y2,Y3,Z1,Z2,Z3 result\n```\n","x":-34560,"y":11360,"width":5440,"height":2920},
		{"id":"5f0f23e86cd509e4","type":"text","text":"process_metadata_generation(For Batch of Tables) ----> get_total_table_count(counts number of tables)---->\nget_table_documents_batch(make batch of tables) ----> process_table ----> \n\n\nSTEP 1: \nGet columns for this table _get_columns_for_table_\n\n","x":-31530,"y":9147,"width":2410,"height":1093},
		{"id":"87c9bd077210b460","type":"text","text":"In PKRT and FKRT there should not be any relationship of the same table. (DONE)\n\nThe relationships should not be the same in FKRT and PKRT\n\n\n\nKeys in PK and FK all should be in PKRT and FKRT.\n\n\n\nAdd time.sleep(600s) or check out other alternative way for automation.(Insert table)\n","x":-35660,"y":-2500,"width":720,"height":520},
		{"id":"b579577ec32ae39f","type":"text","text":"# 1. Iterate FK as well in relationship inference\n\n\n\n# 2. Check only for few tables it is taking relationship of its own table.\n\n\n\n\n# 3. Relationships should not be same in both FKRT and PKRT.","x":-34720,"y":-2680,"width":920,"height":440},
		{"id":"88a9a2445230526b","type":"text","text":"# FK-RT: \n 1.  Pick foreign keys\n 2. Search those FK in 'PK' keys in table_metadata(key matching)\n 3. Store the result in a list\n 4. If the result is null, do a rag on  column metadata take top k=5 then de duplicate it\n 5. then check those 5 columns in table metadata primary key.","x":-34268,"y":-2180,"width":708,"height":380},
		{"id":"875fea2083136e66","type":"text","text":"# PK-RT\n```\nStep 1: Take the primary keys and do the key matching and store it in a list.\n(Keep foreign key logic as it is.)\nStep 2: Instead of doing the semantic of similar tables, i suggest you to do the semantic on similar columns. If you take k=5 columns then you can append them in the list.\nStep 3: Then you will be having two list one is by key matching and one is by semantic, then remove the duplicates means if both the list contains same remove them.\nStep 4: Then remove the conflicts present in the both foreign_keys_referencing_tables and  primary_keys_referencing_tables.\n```","x":-34268,"y":-1773,"width":708,"height":413},
		{"id":"a9f6f04337fcfdbd","type":"text","text":"# Sample Json DATA\n\nTable Data:\n```json\n{\n\"data\": {\n\"id\": \"t1\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"label\": \"Packages\",\n\"be_name\": \"17-18to24-25Packagesv2\",\n\"type\": \"table\",\n\"parent_type\": \"source\",\n\"parent_id\": \"s1\",\n\"parent_name\": \"CRM\",\n\"count\": 18,\n\"description\": \"\"\n},\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"tags\": [],\n\"primary_keys\": [\n\"order_id\"\n],\n\"foreign_keys\": [],\n\"foreign_keys_referencing_tables\": [],\n\"primary_keys_referencing_tables\": [],\n\"created_by\": \"demo_user\",\n\"created_at\": \"2023-10-01T12:00:00Z\",\n\"last_updated_by\": \"relationship_inference\",\n\"updated_at\": \"2025-08-06T05:18:13.105361Z\",\n\"human_feedback\": [\n{\n\"user\": \"\",\n\"comment\": \"\",\n\"timestamp\": \"\"\n}\n],\n}\n```\n\n\n\nColumn Data:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"c1\",\n    \"label\": \"customer_no\",\n\t\"be_name\": \"customer_no\",\n    \"type\": \"column\",\n    \"data_type\": \"Integer\",\n    \"nullable\": false,\n    \"parent_type\": \"table\",\n    \"parent_id\": \"t8\",\n    \"parent_name\": \"DeceasedContwLastActivity\",\n    \"description\": \"\"\n    \n  },\n  \"embedding_input\": \"\",\n  \"sample_values\": [\n    300282,\n    300616,\n    300705\n  ],\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"created_by\": \"demo_user\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2023-10-01T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"last_updated_by\": \"user_ai\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2025-07-24T06:09:09.782925Z\",\n  \"human_feedback\": [\n    {\n      \"user\": \"\",\n      \"comment\": \"\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n}\n````\n\n\n\nSource Data:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"s2\",\n    \"label\": \"Google Analytics\",\n    \"type\": \"source\",\n    \"description\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"embedding_input\": \"\",\n  \"tables\": [\n    \"Events\",\n    \"PseudonymousUsers\",\n    \"Users\"\n  ],\n}\n```\n\n\n\n","x":-52700,"y":7560,"width":820,"height":640},
